 "stimulus_html": "<p>Use the information in the following table to find the winner using each of the voting methods in parts 1 and 2, then answer the question in part 3.</p><br>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Voters</th>\n<th>L</th>\n<th>M</th>\n<th>N</th>\n<th>O</th>\n<th>P</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Option A</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option B</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option C</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option D</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 545732,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Pairwise comparison",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>AB 2 vs BA 3. BA wins, so cross out AB.</p>\n<p>AC 3 vs CA 2. AC wins, so cross out CA.</p>\n<p>AD 4 vs DA 1. AD wins, so cross out DA</p>\n<p>BC 3 vs CB 2. BC wins, so cross out CB.</p>\n<p>BD 3 vs DB 2. BD wins, so cross out DB.</p>\n<p>CD 3 vs DC 2. CD wins, so cross out DC.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%; background: linear-gradient(to top right, transparent calc(50% - 1px), black 50%, transparent calc(50% + 1px) )\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Opponent<br>Runner</th>\n<th>A</th>\n<th>B</th>\n<th>C</th>\n<th>D</th>\n<th>POINTS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>AB 2 Cross out AB 2</td>\n<td>AC 3<p></p>\n<p>wins</p></td>\n<td>AD 4<p></p>\n<p>wins</p></td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>BA 3<p></p>\n<p>wins</p></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>BC 3<p></p>\n<p>wins</p></td>\n<td>BD 3<p></p>\n<p>wins</p></td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>CA 2<p></p>\n<p>Cross out CA 2</p></td>\n<td>CB 2<p></p>\n<p>Cross out CB 2</p></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>CD 3<p></p>\n<p>wins</p></td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>DA 1<p></p>\n<p>Cross out DA 1</p></td>\n<td>DB 2<p></p>\n<p>Cross out DB 2</p></td>\n<td>DC 2<p></p>\n<p>Cross out DC 2</p></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>B wins.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Using the pairwise comparison voting method, Option B wins."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 545733,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Borda count",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>First place earns (4 – 1) or 3 points.</p>\n<p>Second place earns (4 – 2) or 2 points.</p>\n<p>Third place earns (4 – 3) or 1 point.</p>\n<p>Fourth place earns (4 – 4) or 0 points.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Voters</th>\n<th>L</th>\n<th>M</th>\n<th>N</th>\n<th>O</th>\n<th>P</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Option A</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option B</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option C</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Option D</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Option A: 2 + 2 + 1 + 2 + 2 = 9</p>\n<p>Option B: 3 + 0 + 3 + 0 + 3 = 9</p>\n<p>Option C: 1 + 3 + 0 + 3 + 1 = 8</p>\n<p>Option D: 0 + 1 + 2 + 1 + 0 = 4</p>\n<p>Option A and B tie.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Using the Borda count method, Option A and Option B tie."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 545734,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Does the majority criterion apply? If so, for which voting method(s) did the majority criterion fail?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>There are five votes.</p>\n<p>50 percent of five is 2.5.</p>\n<p>A majority would need 3 first-place votes.</p>\n<p>In a simple ballot, Option B would win the majority criterion because Option B had 3 first-place votes. The majority criterion would fail in the Borda count method because Options A and B tied.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Yes. The majority criterion fails for Borda count."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
